## Summary
Fedez, an Italian rapper, has been reported for allegedly participating in a beating incident targeting Iovino. He was identified by surveillance cameras but denies being present, claiming he was elsewhere at the time. The incident involved Ludovica Di Gresy who was present at the venue.

## Key Points
- Fedez has been reported in connection with the Iovino beating case based on camera evidence.
- Surveillance cameras allegedly show Fedez attempting to hit Iovino during the incident.
- Fedez denies his involvement, stating he was not at the scene when the beating occurred.
- Ludovica Di Gresy was present at the location during the incident.
- The case underscores the role of surveillance technology in criminal investigations.


